+'- Backup frequency: '+(s.backup_frequency||'To be defined')+'\n'
+'- Backup retention: '+(s.backup_retention||'To be defined')+'\n'
+'- Restore testing: '+(s.restore_test_frequency||'To be defined')+'\n'
+'- Monitoring scope: '+(s.monitoring_scope||'To be defined')+'\n\n'
+'Support and SLA targets\n'
+'- Target availability: '+(s.target_uptime||'To be defined')+'\n'
+'- Support hours: '+(s.support_hours||'To be defined')+'\n'
+'- Critical response: '+(s.critical_response||'To be defined')+'\n'
+'- High priority response: '+(s.high_response||'To be defined')+'\n'
+'- Standard response: '+(s.standard_response||'To be defined')+'\n\n'
+'Data lifecycle\n'
+'- Data retention: '+(s.data_retention||'To be defined')+'\n'
+'- Data export / exit: '+(s.export_period||'To be defined')+'\n'
+'- Sub-processors: '+(s.subprocessors||'To be defined')+'\n\n'
+'Security contact\n'
+'- '+(s.security_contact_name||'Security contact')+(s.security_contact_email?' <'+s.security_contact_email+'>':'')+'\n'
+'- Escalation: '+(s.incident_escalation||'To be defined')+'\n\n'
+'Note: '+(s.sla_notes||'SLA targets become contractual only when included in a signed agreement.');
